==Strategy==
This stage is an exact copy of [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Parade of the Dead]], though with a restriction in place. Due to the restriction, players are forced to use expensive units such as ubers, certain tanks and suicide attackers (e.g., [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]) to win the battle.

Recommended units should have either [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] or [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] abilities ([[Massive Damage]], [[Resistant]], or [[Strong Against]]) to counter the waves. If you don't have these units, you can also use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] (most useful at lvl. 40, with 2 Sm. defense combos), as he can tank an extra hit, allowing you to deal large amounts of damage to Daboo, as well as be used as an emergency defense should the peons push too hard.

Make sure to keep your ground, however, as the zombies can cut into your units and split them off, and should the angel waves begin to appear, you will be heavily pushed back to your base. Try to regain ground as quickly as possible, because Daboo will most likely approach and even begin hitting the base. To counteract this, bring Sniper the Cat. The amount of protection you provide will dictate the stage's outcome.

